  "notes": "{茹|ゆ}でる is an ichidan verb meaning to cook in boiling water.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{茹|ゆ}でる\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{卵|たまご}→卵：02222_tamago⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{茹|ゆ}でる: to boil an egg\n- ⟦パスタ→パスタ：06768_pasuta⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{茹|ゆ}でる: to boil pasta\n- ⟦{野菜|やさい}→野菜：02265_yasai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{茹|ゆ}でる: to boil vegetables\n- ⟦{固|かた}く→固い：12090_katai⟧{茹|ゆ}でる: to hard-boil\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{茹|ゆ}で{卵|たまご}→ゆで卵：10651_yudetamago⟧: boiled egg\n- ⟦{茹|ゆ}で{上|あ}がる→茹で上がる：17741_yudeagaru⟧: to finish boiling (intransitive)\n- ⟦{半熟|はんじゅく}→半熟：11935_hanjuku⟧{茹|ゆ}で: soft-boiled\n\nSIMILAR COOKING METHODS:\n- ⟦{煮|に}る→煮る：01971_niru⟧: to simmer, stew (longer, with flavoring)\n- ⟦{蒸|む}す→蒸す：02307_musu⟧: to steam\n- ⟦{焼|や}く→焼く：01123_yaku⟧: to grill, bake",
